      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "Just want to add that the new Spatial Audio component does not have an obvious way to do 2D audio like ONSP did. All you needed was the ONSP component and the audio set to 2D and it worked no problem, but Spatial Audio seems to lack that feature. No combination of settings I tried could get it to work (though admittedly I didn't try ALL possible settings).",
