      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "@{58c6da4c23f8d63e1401d385|full_name}: Almost every world with background music or ambient noise (crickets, rain, etc) uses 2D audio. Spatialized background music is actually far more distracting unless it’s logically part of the environment like club speakers. Making easy 2D audio sources for beginners is a MUST. It is one of the FAQs of world builders.",
